OL,3,ASeven arrested after death of newborn
OL,4,Ababy girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after the death of
OL,8,Fa newborn baby girl in Sheffield,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
OL,11,FOfficers were called at about 06:00 BST
OL,12,Fon Sunday to a property on Holywell
OL,13,FHeights in the Wincobank area following
OL,14,Freports of a concern for the safety of
OL,15,Fthe baby.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said, despite
OL,18,Fthe best efforts of officers and
OL,19,Fparamedics, the baby was pronounced
OL,20,Fdead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
